<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Document Template</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .section-header {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .form-row > div {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .label {
    font-weight: normal;
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
  .input-field {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 2px 0;
    min-width: 100px;
  }
  .checkbox-group label {
    font-weight: normal;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .table-container {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }
  .table-container th, .table-container td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .table-container th {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 50px;
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    padding-top: 5px;
    width: 30%;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 18pt;">SOUTHERN ILLINOIS UNIVERSITY EDWARDSVILLE</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt;">2014 Year-End Clerry Crime Reporting Form</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(This is not an official police report)</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p>If you are not aware of any unreported Clerry reportable crimes that occurred in 2014, please verify that by completing the information in this box.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Reporting Person (print name):</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="reporting_person_name">{{ reporting_person_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Department:</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="reporting_department">{{ reporting_department }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p>By placing your initials on this line you are confirming that you have reported all crimes, as described below, that were reported to you in <span data-field="reporting_year">{{ reporting_year }}</span> calendar year 2014.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">Complete the following information if a crime was reported to you earlier in the calendar year and you have not yet reported it to the SUE Police Department. If more than one crime was reported to you, fill out one of these forms for each crime reported. Please forward all completed 2014 Year-End Clerry Crime Reporting Forms to SUE Police Department Records Unit, Campus Box 1143, Edwardsville, IL 62026 or fax to 618-3250 prior to February 15, 2015.</div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">CSA Submitting This Form:</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="csa_submitting_form">{{ csa_submitting_form }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">CSA's Department:</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="csa_department">{{ csa_department }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Dept. Incident #:</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="dept_incident_number">{{ dept_incident_number }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Name of Reporting Party (Voluntary):</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="reporting_party_name">{{ reporting_party_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Name Declined</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="reporting_party_name_declined">{{ reporting_party_name_declined }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Victim:</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="victim_name">{{ victim_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Third Party's Relationship to Victim:</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="third_party_relationship">{{ third_party_relationship }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Date & Time Received by CSA:</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="date_time_received">{{ date_time_received }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Date & Time Crime Occurred:</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="date_time_crime_occurred">{{ date_time_crime_occurred }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Location of Crime (Building Name, Address, Floor, Parking Lot, etc.):</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="crime_location">{{ crime_location }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">Crime Reported (see descriptions below on back):</div>

  <div class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Crime Type</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Aggravated Assault</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Arson</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Battery</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Drug Violation</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Domestic Violence</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Motor Vehicle Theft</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Murder & Non-Negligent Manslaughter</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Negligent Manslaughter</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="crime_type_1">{{ crime_type_1 }}</span></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </div>

  <div class="table-container" style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Destruction/Damage/Vandalism of Property (only if hate crime)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Stalking</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Sex Offense (Forcible)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Sex Offense (Non-Forcible)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Skanking</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </div>

  <div class="table-container" style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Alcohol Violation</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Drug Violation</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Weapon Violation</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Type of Weapon:</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="weapon_type">{{ weapon_type }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">BB/Airsoft Gun</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="weapon_bb_airsoft">{{ weapon_bb_airsoft }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Handgun</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="weapon_handgun">{{ weapon_handgun }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Rifle/Shotgun</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="weapon_rifle_shotgun">{{ weapon_rifle_shotgun }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Knife/Sword</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="weapon_knife_sword">{{ weapon_knife_sword }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Martial Arts Weapon</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="weapon_martial_arts">{{ weapon_martial_arts }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Other (describe below)</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="weapon_other">{{ weapon_other }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">Hate Crime (see description on back):</div>
  <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> If yes, identify the category of prejudice:</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Disability</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Ethnicity</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Gender</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Gender Identity</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> National Origin</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Race</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Religion</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Sexual Orientation</label>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">If yes, provide a brief explanation of how the bias or prejudice was determined:</span>
      <div class="input-field" style="height: 80px;"><span data-field="hate_crime_explanation">{{ hate_crime_explanation }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">Briefly describe the incident and include the names of the suspects and/or individuals referred for disciplinary action (use additional page if necessary):</div>
  <div style="border: 1px solid #000; height: 200px; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="height: 100%;">
      <span data-field="incident_description">{{ incident_description }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">CSA's Disposition of Incident:</div>
  <div class="form-row" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Referred For Discipline by CSA (see below):</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="disposition_referred_by_csa">{{ disposition_referred_by_csa }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Resolved by CSA</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="disposition_resolved_by_csa">{{ disposition_resolved_by_csa }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">No CSA action taken - information forwarded to SUE PD</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="disposition_no_action_taken">{{ disposition_no_action_taken }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Number of Persons Referred for Disciplinary Action:</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="number_persons_referred">{{ number_persons_referred }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Criminal Alcohol Violation</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="criminal_alcohol_violation_count">{{ criminal_alcohol_violation_count }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Criminal Drug Violation</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="criminal_drug_violation_count">{{ criminal_drug_violation_count }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Criminal Weapons Violation</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="criminal_weapons_violation_count">{{ criminal_weapons_violation_count }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Referred to (name):</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="referred_to_name">{{ referred_to_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <span class="label">Referred to (Department):</span>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="referred_to_department">{{ referred_to_department }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">Aggravated Assault: An unlawful attack by one person upon another for the purpose of inflicting severe or aggravated bodily injury. This type of assault usually is accompanied by the use of a weapon or by means likely to produce death or great bodily harm. (It is not necessary that injury result from an aggravated assault when a gun, knife, or other weapon is used which could and probably would result in serious personal injury if the crime were successfully completed.)</div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="signature_reporter">{{ signature_reporter }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="signature_witness">{{ signature_witness }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>